// Race._sess.toGrid puts the field on the grid with the race weather (qDone).
// AI: run planner (plan), release slots (slots: the garage queue resolved backwards from each run's go / deadline), out
// lap (car.qPace 0.78, 2.5 s to the car ahead at the line), push (1; a push lap lost to traffic / a mistake / deleted is
// given up for a cool lap and another go: abortLap), cool (0.7), in lap (wantPit). Lap model pace (expLap): ref lap (Race._sess.refLap: dry softs) x (ref pace / brain pace)^CAL.e x CAL.k x
